# ===== Monorepo .gitignore =====
# Per-project .gitignores also exist in subfolders.
# This is the safety net.

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

# Next.js build artifacts
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/dist/

# Environment files — NEVER COMMIT
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# Vercel
**/.vercel

# IDE / OS
.DS_Store
# macOS AppleDouble resource forks ("._Foo.ts") — sypie je Finder/iCloud na każdym
# nie-HFS wolumenie. Bez tej reguły jeden `git add -A` z checkoutu zsynchronizowanego
# z macOS wrzuca tysiące śmieciowych binarek i psuje każdy tool globujący `**/*.ts`
# (tsc/eslint/vitest widzą "._route.ts" jako źródło). Nigdy nie commituj. (#audit)
._*
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.pem
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.next-dev.log

# TypeScript build cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Prisma migrations (not used in this project — using db push)
**/prisma/migrations/

# Coverage
**/coverage/

# Docs-as-code (generowane) — MkDocs build + TypeDoc API (regenerowane w CI)
/site/
/docs/api/

# Backup / temp files
*.bak
*.tmp
*_pwtest.js

# Skills lock (auto-generated)
**/skills-lock.json

# Agent / Claude artifacts
**/.agents/
**/.claude/
